{
    "title": "Stir - Single Parent Dating",
    "description": "As a <b>single parent</b>, you\u2019ve tried the other dating apps, but when you mention your <b>kids</b> or that you can\u2019t drop everything to go out on a date with your match, you\u2019re no longer interesting.\r\n\r\nSound familiar? Not anymore!\r\n\r\n<b>Change With Stir!</b>\r\nAs seen on CNN, CNBC, and INSIDER, Stir is an app dedicated to giving single parents an online dating experience where they can\r\n- be celebrated,\r\n- have a fulfilling life beyond navigating parenthood,\r\n- and just be themselves!\r\n\r\nWith Stir, you may <b>match, chat and date with other single parents.</b> Non-parents who are open to dating parents and meeting new people are also welcome!\r\n\r\nLet's talk the <b>free stuff</b> first. \r\n\r\nFree mutual likes? Of course! On Stir, it is free to send likes and even to chat with everyone who has a mutual attraction with you. Take advantage of this free communication option once you find a match you like, especially when you first explore the app. Don't hesitate to start chatting right away!\r\n\r\n<b>What About Premium Membership?</b>\r\nThen take the next step and become a paying member. This lets you initiate conversations with anyone and you can get noticed faster by sending <b>super likes.</b>\r\n\r\nYou stand out more which <b>boosts</b> your views or if you are looking for something more low key, you can switch to <b>private mode</b> and only be noticed by people you liked. Find your partner right way!\r\n\r\nOn Stir, you don\u2019t have to apologize for having a busy schedule. Life can be less complicated because Stir offers \u201cStir Time\u201d, a <b>scheduler option</b> that lets you quickly find out if you and someone you like have similar schedules.\r\n\r\n<b>How To Stay Safe?</b>\r\nSingle parents dating often have one shared major concern: safety. With that in mind, Stir has partnered with the <b>National Center for Missing and Exploited Children (NCMEC)</b> to provide members with tips specific to single dating moms and dads.\r\n\r\nWe advise you on how to set up <b>boundaries</b> early on, keep the spotlight on yourself, and what red flags to look out for when embarking on your new adventure.\r\n\r\nAs far as keeping your experience on the dating app safe, Stir has an entire care team dedicated to monitoring photos and profiles and any reported members are reviewed by real humans.\r\n\r\nSpeaking of real humans, Stir has a team focused on detecting and deleting fake accounts. This helps prevent spam and saves you from wasting time. Your account is also protected through phone number verification to makes sure your <b>personal information</b> is safe.\r\n\r\nWhen it comes to non-humans, our unique algorithm has got your back, presenting you with new match recommendations we think you'll love as we learn what you like and don't like after you answer questions on personality and values.\r\n\r\nWith so much information on each profile, Stir makes it easy for you to start a conversation and meet up with local single moms and dads.\r\n\r\nStir is where solo parents can meet online, chat and rediscover the fun in dating. It\u2019s where having kids is never a deal-breaker.\r\n\r\nHere you can find your \u201cevery other weekend\u201d partner or the person with whom you want to blend families. Download Stir now!",
    "descriptionHTML": "As a <b>single parent</b>, you\u2019ve tried the other dating apps, but when you mention your <b>kids</b> or that you can\u2019t drop everything to go out on a date with your match, you\u2019re no longer interesting.<br><br>Sound familiar? Not anymore!<br><br><b>Change With Stir!</b><br>As seen on CNN, CNBC, and INSIDER, Stir is an app dedicated to giving single parents an online dating experience where they can<br>- be celebrated,<br>- have a fulfilling life beyond navigating parenthood,<br>- and just be themselves!<br><br>With Stir, you may <b>match, chat and date with other single parents.</b> Non-parents who are open to dating parents and meeting new people are also welcome!<br><br>Let&#39;s talk the <b>free stuff</b> first. <br><br>Free mutual likes? Of course! On Stir, it is free to send likes and even to chat with everyone who has a mutual attraction with you. Take advantage of this free communication option once you find a match you like, especially when you first explore the app. Don&#39;t hesitate to start chatting right away!<br><br><b>What About Premium Membership?</b><br>Then take the next step and become a paying member. This lets you initiate conversations with anyone and you can get noticed faster by sending <b>super likes.</b><br><br>You stand out more which <b>boosts</b> your views or if you are looking for something more low key, you can switch to <b>private mode</b> and only be noticed by people you liked. Find your partner right way!<br><br>On Stir, you don\u2019t have to apologize for having a busy schedule. Life can be less complicated because Stir offers \u201cStir Time\u201d, a <b>scheduler option</b> that lets you quickly find out if you and someone you like have similar schedules.<br><br><b>How To Stay Safe?</b><br>Single parents dating often have one shared major concern: safety. With that in mind, Stir has partnered with the <b>National Center for Missing and Exploited Children (NCMEC)</b> to provide members with 